id: 27
hanzi: 各自
pinyin: gè zì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Pronoun

meanings_summary:
  en: each; respective; each by oneself; individually
  es: cada uno; respectivamente; por su cuenta; por separado

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Pronoun | Standard | each individual person or entity considered separately and independently | cada uno por su parte; cada cual independientemente | 各自回家 (each returns to their respective homes)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 暴风雨来临前，甲板上的水手们迅速奔赴各自的岗位，紧张有序地执行收帆与加固任务。 | Bàofēngyǔ láilín qián, jiǎbǎn shàng de shuǐshǒumen xùnsù bēnfù gèzì de gǎngwèi, jǐnzhāng yǒuxù de zhíxíng shōufān yǔ jiāgù rènwu. | Before the squall hit, sailors on deck rushed to their respective posts, calmly furling sails and securing lines. | Antes del temporal, los marineros corrieron a sus respectivos puestos para arriar velas y afianzar amarras con presteza.
  #2 | 毕业多年后，昔日的同窗好友奔赴全国各地，在各自的专业领域里默默耕耘、施展才华。 | Bìyè duō nián hòu, xīrì de tóngchuāng hǎoyǒu bēnfù quánguó gèdì, zài gèzì de zhuānyè lǐngyù lǐ mòmò gēngyún, shīzhǎn cáihuá. | Years after graduation, former classmates dispersed across the country, quietly laboring and displaying talents in their respective professional fields. | Años tras graduarse, los antiguos compañeros se dispersaron por todo el país para labrar su camino y desplegar su talento en sus respectivos campos.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  各自负责 | each take responsibility for their own part
  奔赴各自岗位 | rush to respective posts
  各自回家 | each return to one's own home
  表达各自观点 | express respective viewpoints
  各自独立 | each independent
  回到各自生活 | return to respective lives

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  各奔前程 | gè bèn qián chéng | each goes their own way; each pursues their own future
  各自为政 | gè zì wéi zhèng | each administers affairs in their own way; lack of coordination
  各抒己见 | gè shū jǐ jiàn | each airs their own views; express personal opinions freely
  各有千秋 | gè yǒu qiān qiū | each has its own merits; each has something to recommend it

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  各 | gè | each; every; different | cada; cada cual; diverso | 口 | mouth / speech | 夂 (zhǐ / feet walking in opposite directions) | 口 (mouth / speaking different thoughts) | 6 | 上下结构 | Ideogrammic compound: footsteps departing in different directions (夂) with each mouth uttering separate thoughts (口). | Footsteps turning in varied directions (夂) as every person's mouth (口) speaks their own distinct opinion. | Pasos que parten en direcciones divergentes (夂) mientras cada boca (口) expresa su propio parecer. | 51 | HER | ""
  自 | zì | self; oneself; from | uno mismo; propio; desde | 自 | nose / self | 自 (pictograph of human nose pointing to oneself) | "" | 6 | 独体结构 | Ancient pictograph of a human nose, which Chinese speakers naturally point to when referring to oneself ('自'). | An index finger pointing directly at one's own nose (自) to indicate "myself". | Un dedo índice que señala la propia nariz (自) para decir con naturalidad: "yo mismo". | 51 | HAU | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: When distinct individuals (各) act on their own behalf (自), everyone attends to their respective duties (各自).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Cuando cada individuo (各) responde por sí mismo (自), cada uno atiende a sus respectivos asuntos (各自).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Chinese culture balances collective harmony with individual distinctness ('和而不同'). '各自' recognizes that within any team or family, each person carries distinct autonomy and personal agency.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Two consecutive falling 4th tones: gè zì (51-51). Articulate both syllables with balanced, assertive descending pitches.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    各 | gè | each; every | Has 夂 on top and 口 (mouth) at the bottom
    名 | míng | name | Has 夕 on top and 口 at the bottom
    自 | zì | self; from | Six strokes with two horizontal strokes inside
    白 | bái | white | Five strokes with one horizontal stroke inside
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    各位 | gè wèi | everybody; ladies and gentlemen
    各个 | gè gè | each and every; individually
    自己 | zì jǐ | oneself; self
    自觉 | zì jué | conscious; voluntary; self-aware

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 各自 emphasizes individual autonomy and separate execution of actions by multiple parties.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 各自 vs. 大家 | dàjiā | 各自 stresses individual separation where members do distinct things on their own (各自回屋), whereas 大家 stresses collective unity where everyone acts together (大家一起来).
    2 | 各自 vs. 分别 | fēnbié | 各自 is a pronoun modifying actors' separate domains (各自的责任), while 分别 is an adverb describing departure or sequential differentiation (分别出发).
    3 | 各自 vs. 互相 | hùxiāng | 各自 focuses on inward separate focus, whereas 互相 focuses on reciprocal interaction directed toward one another.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 聚会结束时，朋友们挥手道别，重新回到各自的生活轨道中。虽然大家为了生计奔波在不同的城市，但那些并肩奋斗的岁月所结下的情谊，宛如暗夜里闪烁的星辰，在各自的天空下默默闪烁、互相照亮。 | Jùhuì jiéshù shí, péngyoumen huīshǒu dàobié, chóngxīn huí dào gèzì de shēnghuó guǐdào zhōng. Suīrán dàjiā wèile shēngjì bēnbō zài bùtóng de chéngshì, dàn nàxiē bìngjiān fèndòu de suìyuè suǒ jiéxià de qíngyì, wǎnrú ànyè lǐ shǎnshuò de xīngchén, zài gèzì de tiānkōng xià mòmò shǎnshuò, hùxiāng zhàoliàng. | As the gathering ended, friends waved goodbye, returning to their respective life orbits. Though chasing livelihoods across different cities, bonds forged through shared struggle resemble distant stars, quietly illuminating each sky. | Al concluir la reunión, los amigos se despidieron para retomar sus respectivas vidas. Aunque el trabajo los disperse por ciudades distintas, el cariño forjado en fatigas compartidas titila como estrellas hermanas en sus firmamentos.
  #2 | 跨国科研合作项目圆满结题后，来自五大洲的研究机构基于各自的实验数据与理论模型，分别发表了专题学术论文。这种既保持独立思辨又开展深度资源共享的协作范式，有力推动了全球尖端物理学研究的协同创新与突破。 | Kuàguó kēyán hézuò xiàngmù yuánmǎn jiétí hòu, láizì wǔdàzhōu de yánjiū jīgòu jīyú gèzì de shíyàn shùjù yǔ lǐlùn móxíng, fēnbié fābiǎo le zhuāntí xuéshù lùnwén. Zhè zhǒng jì bǎochí dúlì sībiàn yòu zhǎnkāi shēndù zīyuán gòngxiǎng de xiézuò fànshì, yǒulì tuīdòng le quánqiú jiānduān wùlǐxué yánjiū de xiétóng chuàngxīn yǔ tūpò. | Following the completion of the multinational physics project, laboratories across five continents published treatises grounded in their respective data models. This paradigm combining autonomy with resource-sharing accelerates global physics breakthroughs. | Concluido el proyecto científico multinacional, laboratorios de cinco continentes publicaron artículos con sus respectivos modelos empíricos. Este método, que combina criterio propio y datos compartidos, dinamiza la física de vanguardia mundial.
